CHECK:COMPARISON_TO_NULL: Comparison to NULL could be written "!nlh"
#213: FILE: net/netlink/genetlink.c:520:
+	if (nlh == NULL)

Comparisons to NULL in the form (foo == NULL) or (foo != NULL)
are better written as (!foo) and (foo).

